ponsible for widening your perspective", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.2913752913752914, "x1": 0.884742041712404, "y1": 0.3045843045843046}, {"text": "of deception and balance?", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.3076923076923077, "x1": 0.3512623490669594, "y1": 0.3209013209013209}, {"text": "In your response, make detailed reference to your prescribed text.", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.34032634032634035, "x1": 0.6695938529088913, "y1": 0.35353535353535354}, {"text": "OR", "x0": 0.4994511525795829, "y0": 0.39083139083139085, "x1": 0.5290889132821076, "y1": 0.40015540015540013}, {"text": "Question 2 (g) \u2014 Nonfiction \u2014 Anna Funder, Stasiland (20 marks)", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.439005439005439, "x1": 0.6970362239297475, "y1": 0.4522144522144522}, {"text": "To what extent is Funder\u2019s", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.4716394716394716, "x1": 0.36223929747530187, "y1": 0.48174048174048173}, {"text": "ise of language responsible for widening your perspective of", "x0": 0.3809001097694841, "y0": 0.4716394716394716, "x1": 0.8869374313940724, "y1": 0.48484848484848486}, {"text": "restriction and acceptance?", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.48795648795648794, "x1": 0.3600439077936334, "y1": 0.5011655011655012}, {"text": "In your response, make detailed reference to your prescribed text.", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.5205905205905206, "x1": 0.6695938529088913, "y1": 0.5337995337995338}, {"text": "OR", "x0": 0.4994511525795829, "y0": 0.5703185703185704, "x1": 0.5290889132821076, "y1": 0.5796425796425796}, {"text": "Question 2 (h) \u2014 Film \u2014 Peter Weir, The Truman Show (20 marks)", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.6192696192696193, "x1": 0.7047200878155873, "y1": 0.6324786324786325}, {"text": "To what extent is use of language responsible for widening your perspective of", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.6519036519036518, "x1": 0.8869374313940724, "y1": 0.6651126651126651}, {"text": "conformity and deception?", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.6682206682206682, "x1": 0.3578485181119649, "y1": 0.6814296814296814}, {"text": "In your response, make detailed reference to your prescribed text.", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.7008547008547008, "x1": 0.6695938529088913, "y1": 0.714063714063714}, {"text": "OR", "x0": 0.4994511525795829, "y0": 0.7505827505827506, "x1": 0.5290889132821076, "y1": 0.7599067599067599}, {"text": "Question 2 (i) \u2014 Media \u2014 Simon Nasht, Frank Hurley: The Man Who Made History", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.8003108003108003, "x1": 0.8507135016465422, "y1": 0.8127428127428128}, {"text": "(20 marks)", "x0": 0.28869374313940727, "y0": 0.8158508158508159, "x1": 0.3754116355653128, "y1": 0.8282828282828283}, {"text": "To what extent is Nasht\u2019s use of language responsible for widening your perspective of", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.8453768453768454, "x1": 0.8869374313940724, "y1": 0.8585858585858586}, {"text": "discovery and ethics?", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.8616938616938616, "x1": 0.3150384193194292, "y1": 0.8749028749028749}, {"text": "In your response, make detailed reference to your prescribed text.", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.8951048951048951, "x1": 0.6695938529088913, "y1": 0.9083139083139083}], [{"text": "Section II \u2014 Module C: The Craft of Writing", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.06293706293706294, "x1": 0.5949506037321625, "y1": 0.07847707847707848}, {"text": "20 marks", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.09867909867909867, "x1": 0.2217343578485181, "y1": 0.108003108003108}, {"text": "Attempt Question 3", "x0": 0.14270032930845225, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.3106476399560922, "y1": 0.12742812742812742}, {"text": "Allow about 40 minutes for this section", "x0": 0.14270032930845225, "y0": 0.13053613053613053, "x1": 0.47530186608122943, "y1": 0.14063714063714064}, {"text": "Your answer will be assessed on how well you:", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.15462315462315462, "x1": 0.5214050493962679, "y1": 0.18104118104118105}, {"text": "\u00a9 craft language to address the demands of the question", "x0": 0.1734357848518112, "y0": 0.17327117327117328, "x1": 0.6322722283205269, "y1": 0.19968919968919968}, {"text": "\u00a9 use language appropriate to audience, purpose and form to shape meaning", "x0": 0.1734357848518112, "y0": 0.19813519813519814, "x1": 0.7980241492864983, "y1": 0.21134421134421136}, {"text": "Question 3 (20 marks)", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.26573426573426573, "x1": 0.32711306256860595, "y1": 0.2789432789432789}, {"text": "The photo shows a woman and a teenage girl standing in front of a leafy tree, ina", "x0": 0.1690450054884742, "y0": 0.31313131313131315, "x1": 0.7705817782656421, "y1": 0.32556332556332557}, {"text": "suburban backyard. It's an amateurish black-and-white snap of a mother and daughter:", "x0": 0.16794731064763996, "y0": 0.3201243201243201, "x1": 0.8079034028540066, "y1": 0.34498834498834496}, {"text": "it cuts off both subjects at the ankle. The girl is dressed in a gingham school uniform.", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.3434343434343434, "x1": 0.7892425905598244, "y1": 0.35586635586635584}, {"text": "Her hairdo places the picture in about 1960. She is slightly taller than the woman, and", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.3581973581973582, "x1": 0.8057080131723381, "y1": 0.3706293706293706}, {"text": "is looking at the camera with the corners of her mouth drawn back into her cheeks, but", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.372960372960373, "x1": 0.8079034028540066, "y1": 0.3853923853923854}, {"text": "her eyes are not smiling; they are wary and guarded.", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.3885003885003885, "x1": 0.5521405049396267, "y1": 0.40093240093240096}, {"text": "The woman in the photo is in her late 40s. She has short, dark, wavy hair combed back", "x0": 0.1690450054884742, "y0": 0.41802641802641805, "x1": 0.8068057080131723, "y1": 0.43045843045843046}, {"text": "off her forehead. Her brows are dark and level, her nose thin, her lips firmly closed in", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.4257964257964258, "x1": 0.7991218441273326, "y1": 0.4506604506604507}, {"text": "an expression of bitter constraint. Deep, hard lines bracket her mouth. She's wearing a", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.4483294483294483, "x1": 0.8057080131723381, "y1": 0.46076146076146074}, {"text": "straight black skirt, and a black cardigan undone to show a neat white blouse buttoned", "x0": 0.16794731064763996, "y0": 0.4630924630924631, "x1": 0.8090010976948409, "y1": 0.4755244755244755}, {"text": "to the neck. Her hands are hanging by her sides", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.47863247863247865, "x1": 0.5170142700329309, "y1": 0.49106449106449107}, {"text": "(a) Compose a piece of imaginative, discursive, or persuasive writing that is", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.5384615384615384, "x1": 0.8122941822173436, "y1": 0.5516705516705517}, {"text": "12", "x0": 0.8693743139407245, "y0": 0.5392385392385393, "x1": 0.8858397365532382, "y1": 0.5485625485625486}, {"text": "based on the ideas or images explored in the extract.", "x0": 0.1986827661909989, "y0": 0.5555555555555556, "x1": 0.6180021953896817, "y1": 0.5687645687645687}, {"text": "You do not need to include the extract in your composition", "x0": 0.20087815587266739, "y0": 0.5881895881895882, "x1": 0.6663007683863886, "y1": 0.6013986013986014}, {"text": "(b) Explain how the creative decisions that you have made in part (a) were", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.6208236208236209, "x1": 0.8111964873765093, "y1": 0.634032634032634}, {"text": "influenced by a prescribed text from Module C that you studied.", "x0": 0.1986827661909989, "y0": 0.6371406371406372, "x1": 0.7135016465422612, "y1": 0.6503496503496503}, {"text": "The prescribed texts for Module C appear on page 8", "x0": 0.27442371020856204, "y0": 0.7031857031857032, "x1": 0.721185510428101, "y1": 0.7156177156177156}], [{"text": "Section III (continued)", "x0": 0.1525795828759605, "y0": 0.06216006216006216, "x1": 0.3336992316136114, "y1": 0.07536907536907538}, {"text": "The prescribed texts for Section III are:", "x0": 0.15148188803512624, "y0": 0.0947940947940948, "x1": 0.4676180021953897, "y1": 0.108003108003108}, {"text": "Prose Fiction \u2014 Ray Bradbury, The Pedestrian", "x0": 0.1877058177826564, "y0": 0.12742812742812742, "x1": 0.6542261251372119, "y1": 0.14063714063714064}, {"text": "Peter Carey, Report on the Shadow Industry", "x0": 0.411635565312843, "y0": 0.1522921522921523, "x1": 0.7639956092206367, "y1": 0.1655011655011655}, {"text": "\u2014 Catherine Cole, Home", "x0": 0.3754116355653128, "y0": 0.17715617715617715, "x1": 0.5894621295279913, "y1": 0.1895881895881896}, {"text": "\u2014 Stephen King, Crouch End", "x0": 0.3754116355653128, "y0": 0.20124320124320125, "x1": 0.6278814489571899, "y1": 0.21445221445221446}, {"text": "\u2014 Melissa Lucashenko, Dreamers", "x0": 0.3754116355653128, "y0": 0.2261072261072261, "x1": 0.6641053787047201, "y1": 0.23776223776223776}, {"text": "Nonfiction \u2014 Helen Garner, Dear Mrs Dunkley", "x0": 0.1877058177826564, "y0": 0.2727272727272727, "x1": 0.6794731064763996, "y1": 0.2913752913752914}, {"text": "\u2014 George Orwell, The Sporting S", "x0": 0.3754116355653128, "y0": 0.2999222999222999, "x1": 0.6586169045005489, "y1": 0.31313131313131315}, {"text": "\u2014 Sylvia Plath, A Comparison", "x0": 0.3754116355653128, "y0": 0.32400932400932403, "x1": 0.6333699231613611, "y1": 0.3372183372183372}, {"text": "\u2014 Sarah Vowell, What He Said There", "x0": 0.3754116355653128, "y0": 0.34887334887334887, "x1": 0.6904500548847421, "y1": 0.3613053613053613}, {"text": "Speeches \u2014 Burney, First speech to the House of", "x0": 0.1877058177826564, "y0": 0.4063714063714064, "x1": 0.7607025246981339, "y1": 0.4195804195804196}, {"text": "Representatives as Member for Barton", "x0": 0.4105378704720088, "y0": 0.4226884226884227, "x1": 0.7200878155872668, "y1": 0.4358974358974359}, {"text": "\u2014 Steve Jobs, How to Live Before You Die", "x0": 0.3754116355653128, "y0": 0.445998445998446, "x1": 0.7310647639956093, "y1": 0.4592074592074592}, {"text": "\u2014 Paul Keating, Funeral Service of The Unknown Australian", "x0": 0.3754116355653128, "y0": 0.47086247086247085, "x1": 0.8803512623490669, "y1": 0.4840714840714841}, {"text": "Soldier", "x0": 0.4105378704720088, "y0": 0.48717948717948717, "x1": 0.46871569703622395, "y1": 0.4972804972804973}, {"text": "\u2014 JK Rowling, The Fringe Benefits of Failure and the", "x0": 0.3754116355653128, "y0": 0.5104895104895105, "x1": 0.8320526893523601, "y1": 0.5236985236985237}, {"text": "Importance of Imagination", "x0": 0.4105378704720088, "y0": 0.5275835275835276, "x1": 0.6267837541163557, "y1": 0.5407925407925408}, {"text": "Poetry \u2014 Carol Chan, Popcorn", "x0": 0.1877058177826564, "y0": 0.5695415695415695, "x1": 0.5806805708013172, "y1": 0.5944055944055944}, {"text": "\u2014 Robert Frost, Stopping By Woods on a Snowy Evening", "x0": 0.3754116355653128, "y0": 0.6006216006216006, "x1": 0.8463227222832053, "y1": 0.6138306138306139}, {"text": "\u2014 Les Murray, An Absolutely Ordinary Rainbow", "x0": 0.3754116355653128, "y0": 0.6410256410256411, "x1": 0.7815587266739846, "y1": 0.6542346542346542}, {"text": "\u2014 Judith Wright, The Surfer", "x0": 0.3754116355653128, "y0": 0.6658896658896659, "x1": 0.6169045005488474, "y1": 0.679098679098679}, {"text": "Performance \u2014 Luka Lesson, May your pen grace the page", "x0": 0.1877058177826564, "y0": 0.7148407148407149, "x1": 0.7596048298572997, "y1": 0.728049728049728}, {"text": "Poetry", "x0": 0.1877058177826564, "y0": 0.7319347319347319, "x1": 0.24259055982436883, "y1": 0.7443667443667443}]]